        "band_background": "#000000",
        "band_text_color": "#56bdc2",
        "body": "<p>Stop worrying about weight limits and start adventuring with absolute confidence. <strong>Offroad Industries (ORI)</strong> offers Australia’s most comprehensive, <strong>Federally Approved GVM (Gross Vehicle Mass)</strong> upgrades for the Toyota Australia Toyota Tundra 2023 - 2026 range—covering both the <strong>Limited</strong> and <strong>Platinum</strong> models.</p><p>By bundling our ORI GVM Packages with <strong>GCM testing and LS16 certification</strong>, we grant your truck true \"Super-Truck\" status. The <strong>LS16 code</strong> is our secret sauce: a specific engineering modification code for <strong>Gross Combination Mass Re-rating</strong>. This ensures your truck, your gear, and your 4.5T trailer are 100% legal together, whether registered <strong>Pre-Rego (Federal)</strong> or <strong>Post-Rego (State-based)</strong>.</p>",
        "disclaimer": "<p>*Please note that some workshops may apply additional discretionary administration fees to the quoted installation and engineering price. Additionally, all Post-Registration GVM upgrades will incur additional local fees. Shipping is not included in the price.</p>",
